#                     -mount it uses the next /storages/storageNN that is free
#                     on ALL nodes (storage01 = local storage), with matching
#                     names: VG storagevgNN, LV storageNN, GFS2 name storageNN.
#                     Refuses a VG name that exists on any node (each node has a
#                     local VG "storagevg") and a mount point that is in use.
