#                     (was: only this node). Each "[Warning]" line from
#                     vmexsanconnect -cluster-ready is counted as a WARN (was
#                     ignored when the platform was ready). New "Time" checks:
#                     NTP synchronised on each node, clocks of the nodes within
#                     2 s of each other. -mpathalias uses vmexsanconnect
#                     -alias-set when vmexsanconnect is installed (it manages
#                     /etc/multipath.conf), and defaults to all cluster nodes.
