#  1.11.1 2026-11-15  Fix -changeip: all checks (reachable on the new IP, and
#                     answering as the expected node) now run BEFORE anything
#                     is changed and before the confirmation, using a temporary
#                     known_hosts file. Before, a run without the server IP
#                     changed first could already rewrite SSH host keys.
#                     Fix: SSH host keys are recorded as "name,ip" from one scan
#                     of each node's IP, never via /etc/hosts lookups that may
