  -standby    [node ...]             Put nodes in standby (VMs migrate away)
  -unstandby  [node ...]             Bring nodes back from standby
  -maintenance on|off [-nodes ...]   Cluster-wide (or per node) maintenance mode

FENCING (STONITH)
